WEBVTT

00:01:58.489 --> 00:02:01.576
you're going to notice
there's something much deeper going on.

00:02:01.617 --> 00:02:05.163
I've collected thousands of these stories
from people all around the world,

00:02:05.204 --> 00:02:06.747
and I can tell you it's amazing,

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:11.460
because when people recount the memories
in which they had the most fun,

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.172
they tell you about some
of the most joyful and treasured

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:16.424
memories of their lives.

00:02:17.341 --> 00:02:21.262
So in reality, fun is not
just lighthearted pleasure.

00:02:21.888 --> 00:02:23.181
It's not just for kids,

00:02:23.181 --> 00:02:25.808
and it is definitely not frivolous.

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:30.271
Instead, fun is the secret
to feeling alive.